    {
      "key_point_id": "kp_decomposition",
      "statement": "Use a single justified decomposition and identical fragmentation; terms are model-dependent, not unique causal observables. Recompute total and residual terms. Core rows: PM6_pair, BTP_pair. Recompute electrostatic_kJ_mol, dispersion_kJ_mol, exchange_kJ_mol, induction_kJ_mol from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit.",
      "expected": "Use a single justified decomposition and identical fragmentation; terms are model-dependent, not unique causal observables. Recompute total and residual terms. Core rows: PM6_pair, BTP_pair. Recompute electrostatic_kJ_mol, dispersion_kJ_mol, exchange_kJ_mol, induction_kJ_mol from the submitted linked raw outputs and numeric tables. No narrative-only control or reused old scalar receives endpoint credit.",
      "evidence_ids": [
